<title>JAPAN: TSE says to delist Tokai Kogyo on Oct 5.</title>
<headline>TSE says to delist Tokai Kogyo on Oct 5.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Friday that shares of construction firm Tokai Kogyo Co Ltd would be delisted from the first section of the bourse on October 5.</p>
<p>The firm said earlier that it had filed for court protection from creditors and has debts of 511 billion yen.</p>
